    thinking: "**Designing Audio Feedback**\n\nI\'m currently focused on developing a lightweight audio feedback utility. The goal is to provide users with realistic, crisp micro-haptic sounds triggered by actions like tilting, flipping, swiping, or selecting. I\'m leveraging the Web Audio API for synthesized sounds, ensuring zero external asset loading and fast accessibility, with a mute toggle.\n\n\n"
