  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing 3D Interaction**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation of 3D tilt and swipe components. Currently, I\'m focusing on analyzing the key elements that contribute to a truly physical, smooth, and modern feel, specifically exploring the integration of `motion/react` with `useMotionValue` and `useTransform`.\n\n\n**Implementing Physical Movement**\n\nI\'ve been working on a 3D card swipe component with elastic drag behavior for X and Y, incorporating `rotateZ` and `rotateY` transforms linked to the drag position. Now, I\'m integrating a specular sheen effect that adjusts based on the tilt angle, giving the card a more life-like feel. I am also working on the 3D stack depth, with a focus on scale, translate and blur to create realistic physical depth and momentum to the interactions.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
