  planner_response {
    response: "I have updated the application to support **Indian Rupee (\342\202\271)** pricing and feature authentic budget street food spots across **Mumbai, Maharashtra** and **Tamil Nadu**:\n\n- **Indian Rupee (\342\202\271) Pricing & Filter Thresholds**:\n  - Replaced all currency markers with **\342\202\271** across 3D cards, deal badges, back-of-card quick menus, radar blip indicators, walking navigation modals, and saved spots.\n  - Added Indian Rupee budget filters: **All Deals**, **Under \342\202\27150**, **Under \342\202\271100**, and **Under \342\202\271150**.\n  - Updated payment types to reflect local methods (**UPI / GPay**, **PhonePe / Paytm**, **Cash**, **Card**).\n\n- **Regional Filter Controls**:\n  - Added instant regional selector pills: **All India**, **Mumbai (MH)**, and **Tamil Nadu (TN)**.\n\n- **Mumbai (Maharashtra) Food Spots (50m\342\200\223100m)**:\n  - **Ashok Vada Pav & Crispy Chura** (Dadar West) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27125 Jumbo Vada Pav with Golden Garlic Chura*\n  - **Cannon Sizzling Pav Bhaji** (CSMT Fort) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27190 Amul Butter Pav Bhaji + 2 Maskapavs*\n  - **Kyani Heritage Bakery & Irani Chai** (Marine Lines) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27140 Kadak Irani Chai + Bun Maska*\n  - **Kalyan Chowpatty Bhel & Sev Puri** (Girgaon Chowpatty) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27150 Loaded Sev Batata Puri*\n  - **Tibbs Original Frankie & Grill** (Bandra West) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27170 Paneer Schezwan Masala Frankie*\n  - **Siddhivinayak Bombay Grill Sandwich** (Dadar West) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27160 Jumbo Veg Butter Masala Toast*\n\n- **Tamil Nadu (Chennai / Madurai / Coimbatore) Food Spots (50m\342\200\223100m)**:\n  - **Murugan Ghee Podi Idli & Tiffin Stall** (T. Nagar, Chennai) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27145 Ghee Gunpowder Idlis + 4 Chutneys*\n  - **Triplicane Ratna Sambar Dosa Corner** (Triplicane, Chennai) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27165 Crisp Sambar Dosa with Unlimited Sambar*\n  - **Madurai Famous Royal Jigarthanda Stand** (Madurai / Chennai) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27150 Special Royal Jigarthanda with Basundi*\n  - **Chennai Fast Kothu Parotta Stall** (Anna Salai, Chennai) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27180 Sizzling Spiced Kothu Parotta + Salna*\n  - **Mylapore Mami Tiffin & Filter Kaapi Corner** (Mylapore, Chennai) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27155 Frothy Brass Filter Kaapi + Paniyaram*\n  - **Velu Chettinad Street Tiffin** (Town Hall Road, Madurai) \342\200\223 *\342\202\27195 Three-Tier Chettinad Kari Dosa*\n\n- **Full 3D Experience Preserved**:\n  - Interactive 3D tilt deck with swipe gestures and card-flip menu reveals.\n  - 50m\342\200\223100m live rotating proximity radar view with clickable blips.\n  - Live walking navigation with compass bearings, step countdowns, and arrival notifications."
