    response: "To get and manage API keys for your application:\n\n1. **Google Gemini API Key**:\n   - You can generate a free Gemini API key directly from [Google AI Studio API Keys](https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey).\n\n2. **Configuring Keys in AI Studio Build**:\n   - For security, API keys and secrets are managed securely through the **Settings** menu (Environment Variables) in your workspace rather than in chat or client code.\n   - When an integration is added, you can declare the key name in `.env.example` and set its value in the project settings panel.\n\nIf you are looking to integrate a specific external API service (e.g. Google Maps, Gemini AI, or payment gateways), let me know which service you\'d like to configure!"
